WEBVTT

00:04:58.959 --> 00:05:01.887
yonayotgan tog', vulqon ma'nosini beradi.

00:05:01.887 --> 00:05:05.207
Biz bilamizki, Yaponiya — kunchiqar
mamlakat.

00:05:05.207 --> 00:05:08.625
Bu yerda manba yonida quyosh turibdi,

00:05:08.625 --> 00:05:11.752
chunki Yaponiya Xitoyga nisbatan sharqda
joylashgan.

00:05:11.752 --> 00:05:15.642
Quyosh va manba — bu Yaponiya.

00:05:15.642 --> 00:05:18.600
Agar Yaponiya yonida odamni qo'ysak,
nima kelib chiqadi?

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:21.702
Yapon (yaponiyalik).

00:05:21.702 --> 00:05:24.503
Chapdagi iyeroglif — ikkita tog',

00:05:24.503 --> 00:05:26.610
ustma-ust joylashgan.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:29.827
Qadimgi Xitoyda bu surgunni anglatgan,

00:05:29.827 --> 00:05:32.265
chunki Xitoy imperatorlari o'zining
siyosiy